WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.070 --> 00:00:02.330
This is Centaur.

2
00:00:02.660 --> 00:00:08.840
A brand new CRM solution with AI agents built in, that do the sales admin for your team.

3
00:00:09.550 --> 00:00:12.590
Alex is a rep who starts the day already up to date.

4
00:00:13.180 --> 00:00:18.390
Centaur lines up what needs attention, with the most important tasks at the top of the list.

5
00:00:19.270 --> 00:00:21.910
Meanwhile, the Centaur agents have been busy:

6
00:00:22.240 --> 00:00:25.700
drafting replies to incoming emails, opening deals,

7
00:00:25.810 --> 00:00:30.660
updating the deal records from emails, and preparing meeting briefs for the day ahead.

8
00:00:31.460 --> 00:00:32.610
Here's one of them now.

9
00:00:32.980 --> 00:00:35.820
Hannah, at Granite Learning Trust, sent an inquiry.

10
00:00:36.910 --> 00:00:42.510
She has a sales team of forty reps and currently using Pipedrive, asking about pricing.

11
00:00:43.480 --> 00:00:47.230
The agent replied, and asked some relevant qualification questions:

12
00:00:47.630 --> 00:00:52.080
how many CRM users do you have, and when do you want to buy something by.

13
00:00:53.050 --> 00:00:54.690
Hannah answered the questions.

14
00:00:54.990 --> 00:00:57.890
Budget agreed, and want to be live before Christmas.

15
00:00:58.620 --> 00:01:01.660
So the agent offered a call with Cody, and booked it in.

16
00:01:02.630 --> 00:01:04.830
Then, Centaur did all the admin.

17
00:01:05.500 --> 00:01:08.560
It created the account, the contact and the deal,

18
00:01:08.810 --> 00:01:13.840
set the value from the email thread, and noted Pipedrive as the incumbent product.

19
00:01:14.440 --> 00:01:16.550
It qualified the deal against BANT.

20
00:01:17.120 --> 00:01:19.150
And nobody has had to type a thing.

21
00:01:19.870 --> 00:01:23.090
As things change, Centaur keeps the deal up to date.

22
00:01:23.940 --> 00:01:26.070
Before the call, Hannah writes again:

23
00:01:26.450 --> 00:01:31.770
55 users now, signing by December 15th, and they're also looking at HubSpot.

24
00:01:32.660 --> 00:01:39.870
The agent flags HubSpot as a risk, adds it as a competitor, and refreshes the deal summary.

25
00:01:40.370 --> 00:01:42.980
Then it suggests the new value and close date.

26
00:01:43.410 --> 00:01:45.910
One click each, and the deal is current.

27
00:01:46.830 --> 00:01:48.330
And you stay in control.

28
00:01:48.590 --> 00:01:53.490
Every draft waits for your approval, until you're happy to let the agents send on their own.

29
00:01:54.280 --> 00:01:55.660
Centaur CRM.

30
00:01:56.080 --> 00:01:58.050
Give your sales team their time back.

31
00:01:59.080 --> 00:02:03.000
Book a demonstration today, at centaurcrm.com.
